                    {
                        "translation_id": "14d0a597-7fa4-49cf-86a4-4c01e54912c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "6fbce334-2d66-3f5d-8174-8a1dd674efcb",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1414db3-2587-3d33-bacb-ac219e116c8c",
                        "target_lang_word": "great",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "great",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "867e9190-a236-3f3b-83db-ebb0b65e7255",
                                        "entry_id": "784b6767-762c-3506-8a77-3b1c4b291819",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Taking much space; large."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd4da3fc-9825-4c90-acb3-31ab3b90a136",
                                                "sense_id": "867e9190-a236-3f3b-83db-ebb0b65e7255",
                                                "text": "“[…] the awfully hearty sort of Christmas cards that people do send to other people that they don't know at all well. You know. The kind that have mottoes like // Here's rattling good luck and roaring good cheer, / With lashings of food and great hogsheads of beer.[…]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "840f47f0-2204-4c8d-877b-4e590aee2ff6",
                                                "sense_id": "867e9190-a236-3f3b-83db-ebb0b65e7255",
                                                "text": "‘Children crawled over each other like little grey worms in the gutters,’ he said. ‘The only red things about them were their buttocks and they were raw. Their faces looked as if snails had slimed on them and their mothers were like great sick beasts whose byres had never been cleared.[…]’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1aed6be4-3a62-4b0e-bcd1-7b1c59267f4e",
                                                "sense_id": "867e9190-a236-3f3b-83db-ebb0b65e7255",
                                                "text": "Hidden behind thickets of acronyms and gorse bushes of detail, a new great game is under way across the globe. Some call it geoeconomics, but it's geopolitics too. The current power play consists of an extraordinary range of countries simultaneously sitting down to negotiate big free trade and investment agreements."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c614b1c-04e6-3671-ba0a-ec09e0837963",
                                        "entry_id": "784b6767-762c-3506-8a77-3b1c4b291819",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Taking much space; large.",
                                            "Much, more than usual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of an abstract noun"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6be116b-3b21-4dfa-90da-eab0a9f35360",
                                                "sense_id": "9c614b1c-04e6-3671-ba0a-ec09e0837963",
                                                "text": "great worry"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29febca9-4593-4987-a206-038ccf57020a",
                                                "sense_id": "9c614b1c-04e6-3671-ba0a-ec09e0837963",
                                                "text": "“We are engaged in a great work, a treatise on our river fortifications, perhaps? But since when did army officers afford the luxury of amanuenses in this simple republic?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f298d67e-be5f-4a54-a873-97fc98ebc95a",
                                                "sense_id": "9c614b1c-04e6-3671-ba0a-ec09e0837963",
                                                "text": "The first half of this century has been referred to as the golden age of medicine. To me it seems more probable that we are on the threshold of a much greater age."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d56ccf7-73ad-3c7d-bee3-ea627883908f",
                                        "entry_id": "784b6767-762c-3506-8a77-3b1c4b291819",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Taking much space; large.",
                                            "Intensifying a word or expression, used in mild oaths."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "481c8997-aa92-401f-90b3-8cfd3c7676d7",
                                                "sense_id": "0d56ccf7-73ad-3c7d-bee3-ea627883908f",
                                                "text": "a dirty great smack in the face"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fbc79c5-9763-482e-9d8d-34c3bd2c529c",
                                                "sense_id": "0d56ccf7-73ad-3c7d-bee3-ea627883908f",
                                                "text": "Great Scott!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "880a2ba6-f834-3350-837f-651a4ee5e2e3",
                                        "entry_id": "784b6767-762c-3506-8a77-3b1c4b291819",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very good; excellent; wonderful; fantastic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40d055fc-5800-4683-b128-455a471fa6a7",
                                                "sense_id": "880a2ba6-f834-3350-837f-651a4ee5e2e3",
                                                "text": "Dinner was great."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1f5261f-8298-42fc-ae70-15256e2def99",
                                                "sense_id": "880a2ba6-f834-3350-837f-651a4ee5e2e3",
                                                "text": "He was thinking; but the glory of the song, the swell from the great organ, the clustered lights,[…], the height and vastness of this noble fane, its antiquity and its strength—all these things seemed to have their part as causes of the thrilling emotion that accompanied his thoughts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51538b23-cbc2-3ee6-862f-eec47ef4ad62",
                                        "entry_id": "784b6767-762c-3506-8a77-3b1c4b291819",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Important, consequential."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cf6dcfe-6fa5-4047-8a7a-38ccb453249c",
                                                "sense_id": "51538b23-cbc2-3ee6-862f-eec47ef4ad62",
                                                "text": "a great dilemma"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "271eee35-2b1a-4953-96a5-031b468d95df",
                                                "sense_id": "51538b23-cbc2-3ee6-862f-eec47ef4ad62",
                                                "text": "a great decision"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87fba914-3fba-4bea-985f-8167762fc809",
                                                "sense_id": "51538b23-cbc2-3ee6-862f-eec47ef4ad62",
                                                "text": "So the King made Daniel a great man […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a634aec-14c5-49d3-8b2a-5a068ba60f21",
                                                "sense_id": "51538b23-cbc2-3ee6-862f-eec47ef4ad62",
                                                "text": "The Dawn is over-caſt, the Morning low’rs,\nAnd heavily in Clouds brings on the Day,\nThe great, th’ important Day; big with the Fate\nOf Cato and of Rome."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7fafff1-2183-4857-b30e-fc779763a48f",
                                                "sense_id": "51538b23-cbc2-3ee6-862f-eec47ef4ad62",
                                                "text": "The methods for finding parameters that are commonly used in RBC models include using coefficients that come from microeconomic studies for parameters like the time discount factor, rental income over total income for the parameters of a Cobb-Douglas production function, and adjusting parameters so that stationary state value values approach those of the great ratios such as consumption over income and capital over income."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d76de7c1-93d7-4535-bef5-e59249b192b5",
                                                "sense_id": "51538b23-cbc2-3ee6-862f-eec47ef4ad62",
                                                "text": "I’ll cover fiscal theory and the recent inflation (again!) of course, but also more recent thoughts on the great puzzle of monetary economics, how central banks can lower inflation by raising nominal interest rates."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6fb6e683-bc19-3d46-945a-ae43a5a23996",
                                        "entry_id": "784b6767-762c-3506-8a77-3b1c4b291819",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Involving more generations than the qualified word implies — as many extra generations as repetitions of the word great (from 1510s)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
